<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Hero (the commander) and troop characters of Commander Battle's Khuzait troop classes (cb_mpclassdivisions_khuzait.xml),
  merged into Native's mpcharacters.xml (MPCharacters, MultiplayerGame only). All new ids: the stock characters stay
  untouched. Same rules as cb_mpcharacters_vlandia.xml:
  - default_group sets the class group, hence the role (Infantry, Ranged, Cavalry, HorseArcher).
  - Bots draw every equipment slot from a random roster of their character (Equipment.GetRandomEquipmentElements with a
    seed rolls again per slot), so each slot holds the same kind of item in every roster: the rosters vary the looks,
    never the loadout. Weapons are the same in every roster (shields only vary between ones of the same size and
    kind); the weapon setups (perks) swap them.
  - Slots: Item0 main weapon (or bow), Item1 shield (or arrows), Item2 sidearm. Horse archers carry no shield.
    A Cape (shoulders) slot is used by medium and heavy classes, in every roster of the character.
  - Gear tiers, Khuzait a step lighter on foot (variance pass): light = levy (leather or suede coats, a real helmet, a
    small wicker shield, a proper weapon and a sidearm); medium = common men-at-arms (strapped lamellar or studded
    leather, light shoulders, a good helmet); heavy = the khan's guard (bronze and metal lamellar, noble helmets, the
    best weapons and horses). The foot archers are the lightest of any culture; the horsemen ride agile steppe horses.
  - Items only from Native's mpitems.xml.
-->
